			; <i><span class="en">13, 5</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flamma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 5, 24</span></i>
			; Dracont. Hexaëm. 1, 257.</div>
